    <string name="privacy_contact_body">Developer and publisher: Naimish Gupta. Privacy contact: naimish.app@gmail.com. Postal address: Sandi, Hardoi, 241403, Uttar Pradesh. Public policy: https://naimish0.github.io/Magnetrail/.</string>
